Under Secretary of State for Economic Affairs Jacob Helberg will travel to India from February 20-21, where he will join the U.S. delegation to the India AI Impact Summit led by the White House Office of Science and Technology Policy Director, Michael Kratsios. The Under Secretary will hold bilateral meetings and deliver remarks at the conference to further the United States’ economic relationship and partnerships in emerging technologies with India and help launch the next phase of the American AI Exports Program, part of the AI Action Plan.

